            "review_title": "Review at Crab - Grill and Draught Beer",
            "review_text": "Ifigenia Alexandra - România\nArad, Romania30 contributions\n2\nI recommend this place, although it has very few reviews! Must eat here❤️🍣🍛🦀🍤🍜\nMar 2019 • Couples\nMust come here! \n\nMy husband and me came from Romania to visit Ho Chi Minh for 3 days. We stayed at Eastin Saigon Hotel, which was very close from this restaurant. \nBefore eating here we tried 3 more restaurants, but were not impressed by the food, the stuff and the prices. \nWhen we finally came here, we ordered Crabs 🦀 and grilled sepias. Must say that the taste was amazing, food well cooked and the prices were reasonable. \nI recommend this place ! \nI will attach some photos to show you what we ate and the price we paied for a generous meal. Ps- bear was cheaper than in other restaurants and so was the crab and seafood. The taste was incomparable. Very good 🍤🍜❤️🦀\nRead more\nWritten March 16, 2019",
