            "review_title": "Review at Crab - Grill and Draught Beer",
            "review_text": "Dyganon\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia1247 contributions\n1\nSeafood feast\nSep 2017 • Couples\n5 mins Walking distance from Eastin Grand hotel.\n\nAlways out favourite restaurant when we visiting, this is the place with seafood feast at reasonable price.\n\nThe service is top notch. The beer never get warm. Outdoor seating is just so nice in the evening.\n\nHong Kong style crab was fantastic. Singapore chilli crab is above average. Crab spring rolls is amazing. \n\nBeen here 2 times in a week. Bring your own wine. They only serve beer here.\nRead more\nWritten September 14, 2017",
