            "review_title": "Review at Crab - Grill and Draught Beer",
            "review_text": "Dyganon\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia1247 contributions\n1\nLive seafood feast\nMar 2016 • Friends\nThe restaurant is clean. \n\nA bit lost in translation. The staff here don't speak English. But they are trying the best.\n\nShame run out of clams. We ended up order 1 kg of live massive prawns hald grilled and half cook in a hot pot. Delish.\n\nFried morning glory and egg fried rice was great. The chicken wings was average.\n\nBeer is cheap here. Tiger crystal is only 17,000 a bottle. Bring your own wine coz they don't serve wine here.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 4, 2016",
